  "instructions": [
    "Cook the tagliatelle in salted boiling water until al dente, then drain and set aside.",
    "Heat olive oil in a large pan over medium heat and sauté the onion and garlic until translucent.",
    "Add the tomatoes, pumpkin, and kale, cooking until the vegetables soften.",
    "Stir in the cumin, cloves, and coconut cream, letting the sauce simmer for about 5 minutes.",
    "Fold in the cooked tagliatelle, mixing until the pasta is well coated with the coconut sauce.",
    "Season with salt, pepper, and lemon juice, then add the fresh parsley.",
    "If using eggs, top each serving with a poached or fried egg.",
    "Serve immediately, garnished with additional parsley if desired."
  ],
